<title>UK: Capital Radio sells television studio.</title>
<headline>Capital Radio sells television studio.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Capital Radio Plc said on Wednesday it had agreed to sell its television studio, Capital Studios Ltd, to Prospect Media Group Ltd for 2.5 million stg in cash.</p>
<p>In addition, Capital Studios paid a pre-completion dividend of 1.35 million stg to Capital Radio, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>As part of the deal, Capital Radio will invest 1.0 million stg in Prospect in return for a 20 percent shareholding in the Prospect group.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
